# Error: a `comptime` binding is a constant

# Reassigning a `comptime` name is refused by the checker. At statement level the language
# does not tell assignment from declaration (`N = 6` is a declaration), so the check lives
# in the declaration: the one the ComptimeEvaluator generated marks the name in the scope,
# and a later declaration of the same name in that scope is this reassignment.
comptime N = 5;
N = 6;
write(N);
